        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and depressive symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling really hopeless and helpless, asking 'what's the point' and feeling useless. Reports ongoing low mood, anhedonia, poor motivation, reduced energy, and poor concentration at work and home. Timeline is vague: 'been bad for ages maybe worse last few weeks.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Broken sleep; stays up late on phone, sometimes awake until 4 am, and wakes unrefreshed."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Appetite and weight"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Appetite is erratic: sometimes eats nothing all day, then binges on junk food at night. Possible slight weight loss, uncertain; no recent weight recorded in the electronic medical record."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Guilt and hopelessness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling guilty and like a burden to her sister, with prominent hopelessness: 'nothing I try makes a difference.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal thoughts"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Passive suicidal ideation: 'wouldn't matter if I didn't wake up.' No active plan or intent today. Reports past superficial cutting, last more than 6 months ago; no recent self-harm disclosed. Identifies her sister as support and says she would tell her or return if suicidal ideation worsened."
      }
    },
    {
